body:
Before:

```js
app.get('hasOwnProperty');
// => [Function: hasOwnProperty]

app.enabled('hasOwnProperty');
// => true
```

After:

```js
app.get('hasOwnProperty');
// => undefined

app.enabled('hasOwnProperty');
// => false
```

See #4802 for more details.

